    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26864" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐκαιο-δότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, = Lat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>juridicus,</i> at Alexandria, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
